parts.text:
**Line Item Quantity Distribution (1-50)**

Quantities range from 1 to 50 with relatively uniform distribution (~1,150-1,300 orders per quantity level). Quantity 23 has the highest frequency (1,300), while quantity 38 has the lowest (1,154). This fairly even distribution suggests no particular quantity dominates orders - customers order varying amounts across the full range.

{{suggestion: Show quantity distribution grouped into ranges (e.g., 1-10, 11-20, 21-30, etc.)}}

